"alg.schermaan" = "Keep the screen on during a session";
"alg.schermaan.uitleg" = "Stops macOS from dimming or switching off the screen while the lid is open. That also keeps the lock away, since locking follows the screen going off. The two choices above only govern what the app itself does; this one holds the system back. With the lid closed it lets go and those choices take over.";

